{
  "title": "Outrageously Smoky Moroccan Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A resinous, juicy, and comforting Moroccan dish featuring dark rum and smoky flavors, perfect for a cold night, and Whole30-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
